    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Currently in an Alpha Development. Join the Discord for early playtesting!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>THE PITCH</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THE PITCH</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a zero-gravity, momentum-based arena sport where two teams compete to pass, dash, and use teamwork to throw or slam the ball into the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based movement with a physics-based ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab teammates and use their momentum (and teamwork) to soar across the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air dash for fast and fluid direction changes - fake out the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab opponents and stun them to stop them in their tracks to shift the game momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual passing and shooting for a high skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad and KBM compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 5 minute matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2v2 and 1v1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic PVP matchups make for endless replayability</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization - express yourself</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned competitive/ranked modes for unlocking exclusive cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned multiple  environments\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With wall and player-based jumps, air dashes, and game-changing stuns, every moment is a fast, fluid test of reflexes and teamwork.\u00a0Tight controls and dynamic matchups make every play feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>Currently in an Alpha Development. Join the Discord for early playtesting!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/209564b44281d10b8b79a1c19610b41b.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>THE PITCH</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THE PITCH</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a zero-gravity, momentum-based arena sport where two teams compete to pass, dash, and use teamwork to throw or slam the ball into the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based movement with a physics-based ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab teammates and use their momentum (and teamwork) to soar across the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air dash for fast and fluid direction changes - fake out the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab opponents and stun them to stop them in their tracks to shift the game momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manual passing and shooting for a high skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad and KBM compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 5 minute matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2v2 and 1v1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic PVP matchups make for endless replayability</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization - express yourself</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned competitive/ranked modes for unlocking exclusive cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned multiple  environments\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/995d1adbbd93778e892607a79cac0eab.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With wall and player-based jumps, air dashes, and game-changing stuns, every moment is a fast, fluid test of reflexes and teamwork.\u00a0Tight controls and dynamic matchups make every play feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.poster.avif?t=1755637426\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.webm?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/f3e6cb4c663c041f59cc5c11340c9cba.mp4?t=1755637426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "The Pitch is a fast-paced arena sport. Dash, jump, and glide through zero gravity to pass, steal, and score. Master wall jumps, air dashes, and perfectly timed stuns in PvP/PvE matchups. Every move counts in this high-skill, momentum-driven game where teamwork and reflexes decide who wins.",
